{"title":"2021 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The operation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/1/53196dddfbaf8145fd14be11cf568c5154588ed5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\nabla$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> is defined by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/f/aef978eae29ba64ec014b8fb89274cd9f88858be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\nabla b = (a + 1)(b - 2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"167\" height=\"20\" /> for real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />. For example, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/b/0cb2d0fd6f68c2b27656b92ce478227bcd2a222e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4 \\nabla 5 = (4 + 1)(5 - 2) = 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"211\" height=\"20\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/3/3b3da9605d0bfe52a4a888c66f217089f9fa813d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 \\nabla x = 30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"79\" height=\"14\" />, what is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/f/aef978eae29ba64ec014b8fb89274cd9f88858be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\nabla b = (a + 1)(b - 2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"167\" height=\"20\" /> for real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/4/924708c322f8e71cfbeb9986fcaefb46d2413423.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 \\nabla x = (5 + 1)(x - 2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"171\" height=\"20\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/a/ecafce2a8be3ffe4a45281f0c4076c5039b56911.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6(x - 2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"67\" height=\"20\" />. This means that:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/2/a82031e127149f36caf4560179f93f36e7dddc61.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6(x - 2) = 30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"109\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/c/d2c3764f882195aa59612b91d82f37697b3840b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x - 2 = \\frac{30}{6} = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"123\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/d/46d12d3d43423d8b3d214e6fb955a0d40586bc1a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 5 + 2 = \\boxed{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"121\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Verifying_Solution\">Verifying Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Verifying Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/d/62d1e7375e601943b3bb958a24e41da8920d601a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 7$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/f/1cff5ebc541694f05c974003a409bc4dd80b794a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 \\nabla 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"35\" height=\"14\" /> would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/d/edd041fbe77af2948b07f0e6b533c42f1b2ad467.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(5 + 1)(7 - 2) = 6 \\times 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"176\" height=\"20\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/1/651ba418a810d971dbc8a326d49a71fe1541fae0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. This matches the actual value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/a/93a7bdf61c45a43fb77fe37ebd75cf2de653d1b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 \\nabla x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"36\" height=\"14\" />, so we have verified our solution for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC\" title=\"2021 CSMC\">2021 CSMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CSMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CSMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1\" title=\"2021 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 1\">Part A Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3\" title=\"2021 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 3\">Part A Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1\" title=\"2021 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 1\">Part A 1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Part A 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3\" title=\"2021 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 3\">Part A 3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">Part A 4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">Part A 5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">Part A 6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1\" title=\"2021 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 1\">Part B 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Part B 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3\" title=\"2021 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 3\">Part B 3</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Senior_Competition\" title=\"CEMC Senior Competition\">CEMC Senior Competition</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018063545\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.032 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.061 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 156/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1283/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 134/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3811/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    8.945      1 Template:CEMC_CIMC/CSMC_box\n100.00%    8.945      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37386:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018063545 and revision id 289008. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}